WEBVTT

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.830
Kanae Hidehiko-san...

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:16.330
Right?

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:18.200
You're a Selector.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:22.740
You, too?

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.270
How did you know my na—

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:26.790
Have you heard of the bookmaker?

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:30.080
Yeah, I've heard the rumors.

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:36.280
The bookmaker matches Selectors 
with others of a similar level.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:38.220
If you make a contract with him,

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:43.170
you won't have to hurry to find an opponent 
when the time limit draws near.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:46.140
If you like, I'll introduce you.

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:48.310
Who are you?

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:50.160
Why are you telling me this?

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.400
I'll pass.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.180
You look like you're planning something.

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:57.160
A shame.

00:00:57.970 --> 00:00:59.120
Then how about this?

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:04.960
Want to do it with me?

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:39.010
Battle / Past and Present

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.590
Attack!

00:02:42.940 --> 00:02:43.390
Guard.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:47.730
Damn it!

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:49.980
Attack! Attack! Attack!

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.260
Damn it! Turn end!

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:56.500
Meru, grow.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:58.090
Summon SIGNI.

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:02.190
At the same time, coin bet.

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:08.160
Berserk.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:12.560
Full attack.

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:18.690
Turn end.

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:21.300
Okay, attack with all we've got!

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:22.570
Calm down!

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:25.600
She's controlling you with her ability!

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:26.820
If we use our coin—

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:27.810
Shut up!

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:30.750
If I hit her one more time, I can win!

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:34.160
Summon three SIGNI, and full attack!

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:37.970
ARTS: End of Heart.

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:54.250
Now you only have one coin left.

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:58.560
If the time limit comes and you 
can't find an opponent...

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:04.580
Want me to introduce you to the bookmaker?

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:08.790
Bravo!

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.230
I'm moved, Chinatsu-chan.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:14.100
You already got a contract for me.

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:16.690
You might be cut out for this job.

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:21.070
Perhaps I've found someone 
with unexpected talent.

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:23.330
I only did as you told me to.

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:25.780
And that's what's amazing!

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:30.500
I can't ask just anyone to do this job.

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:35.360
You need to be strong in battle, 
and strong here, too.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:37.680
Just out of curiosity,

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:40.630
why did you decide to accept?

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:44.600
I wanted to get a job quickly.

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:46.550
A job, huh?

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:50.590
I'll pay you the promised money, of course.

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:53.020
So, Chinatsu-chan...

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:56.240
This is the next person for you to recruit.

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:02.300
Rio-chan, see you tomorrow.

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.930
Okay, bye!

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:08.640
Hello.

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:12.430
The Selector lady...

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:15.270
Do you want to battle again?

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:16.540
Nope.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:18.960
I wanted to play with you today.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:21.300
With me?

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.560
I see... Your mom?

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:42.150
Yeah, when I was in third grade.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.500
I want to see her again.

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:50.740
I kept praying to God that I'd be able to.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:55.650
And then I was able to become a Selector!

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.500
I named my LRIG "Mommy."

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.480
Because she's kind of like Mommy!

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:03.300
Aww, that makes me happy.

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:06.290
Sometimes, she yells at me.

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:08.120
"Is your homework done?"

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:09.930
"You have to eat your green peppers!"

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:13.090
When I see you, I just can't 
help saying those things.

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:16.930
And I can't help listening when you do!

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.670
But...

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:22.800
She's not my real mom.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:26.740
So I'll use the battles to 
bring back my real mom!

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.790
Don't you know?

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:33.870
Once you get five coins, you can change 
a memory into anything you want!

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:38.920
I'm going to win the battles and erase 
the memory of Mom's death!

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:42.060
And then she won't be dead, right?

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:47.940
You're really smart, Rio-chan.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:49.170
Right?

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:55.700
Listen, Rio-chan.

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:59.480
If you want to do that, you need 
to win lots of battles, right?

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:04.740
And to do that, you need to be able
to find Selectors to fight, right?

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:06.190
Yeah, I do.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:10.400
I know someone called the bookmaker.

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:14.400
You can ask him to find the 
next person for you to fight.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:17.080
Wouldn't it be nice to know someone like that?

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:18.910
Yeah, it would!

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.680
Where is he?

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:44.480
Hey, Riru...

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:45.860
What?

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.820
Am I dependent on you?

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:54.070
Have I been depending on other 
people, like Hanna-chan said?

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:58.330
I was wondering if that's why 
Chi-chan doesn't like me anymore.

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:03.540
Riru, you were made from my 
memories of Chi-chan, right?

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:04.830
Yes.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:07.980
Are you helping me because you're my friend?

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.050
Or...

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:14.340
I'm sorry...

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:16.900
What am I saying?

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:21.420
I'm sorry.

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:25.560
All right, here's your pay.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:28.190
I tossed in a little extra.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:30.660
Glad to have you on board.

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:32.740
Did she make the contract?

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:34.110
She?

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:35.980
Oh, Rio-chan?

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:39.200
She did, thanks to you!

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:43.660
You look like you want to say something.

00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:47.540
Is there a need to get someone 
that young caught up in this?

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:50.170
I don't understand what you're asking.

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:52.930
You want to make people battle 
until they're desperate,

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:55.220
and then enjoy watching 
them struggle, don't you?

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:57.390
She only wants to win the battles

00:08:57.390 --> 00:09:01.270
to escape from the fact that her mother's dead.

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:02.980
Isn't one free

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:07.090
to wish for whatever reward 
one desires for victory?

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:10.700
And one can't escape the battles.

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:15.230
We just help them out a little.

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:16.120
Huh?

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.200
Wait... Huh?!

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:21.880
Are you actually feeling 
sympathetic, Chinatsu-chan?

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:24.460
Because she's the same as you?

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:25.570
No. I—

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:27.790
You're getting rid of her, right?

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:30.460
Of your memories of Suzuko-chan?

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:32.000
What are you trying to say?

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:35.020
That's right, you said...

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:37.130
Um, what was it?

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:38.230
I remember!

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:40.960
You're going to live the way you want, right?

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:44.130
"I'll cut the chains that bind me.

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:46.200
I'll live freely!

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:51.820
So I'm going to get stronger. I'll win the 
Selector battles and be rid of you."

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:52.440
Right?

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:57.070
You're going to get rid of the 
chains that tie you down.

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:59.830
But can you really give them up?

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:00.820
What do you mean?

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:06.080
I don't know if someone who sympathizes 
with a girl like that can be rid of her.

00:10:06.550 --> 00:10:08.670
Be rid of Suzuko-chan, I mean.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:09.330
Chi-chan...

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:11.330
Of course I can.

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:14.000
I'm getting rid of Suzuko for my own sake.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.200
That's why I'm here.

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:20.600
I'm looking forward to the moment 
when I can see you shed your skin

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:25.770
and become a truly beautiful, strong creature.

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:27.770
It doesn't matter.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:30.680
I'm getting rid of Suzuko for my own reasons.

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:32.230
Good girl.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:35.070
And I have good news for you.

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:40.030
Suzuko-chan lost a battle 
and now has just one coin left!

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:46.410
Don't betray my expectations, Chi-chan.

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:01.200
Yes?

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:01.970
Hello.

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:03.260
It's Satomi.

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:07.000
Thanks for that last battle.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:09.780
Shame it didn't work out, Suzuko-chan.

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:12.150
So, I'm afraid I have another one for you.

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:22.160
She requested you.

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:34.000
Chi-chan, listen, I...

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:38.920
There was a lot I wanted to say.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:41.220
Sometimes, all I could do was send letters,

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:44.260
but they all came back.

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:47.890
I went straight to your house when I got here.

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:49.720
You moved, huh?

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:52.140
I thought you might not be 
in this city anymore.

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:55.280
So when we met, I was really happy.

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:59.000
Suzu, do you think everything I said was a lie,

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:01.570
and that we can go back to 
being friends like we were?

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:04.950
You never change.

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:08.200
You haven't up to now, and you never will.

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:10.620
You're a chain that binds me.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:13.430
Now, let's battle.

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:14.500
You can't escape.

00:12:18.440 --> 00:12:19.610
Open.

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:32.280
We go first, Suzuko.

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:35.010
Grow.

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:41.940
Suzuko?

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:46.730
I waited every day for a letter from you.

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:48.910
You were on the middle school 
basketball team, right?

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:51.910
I thought that was just like you.

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:54.660
Suzuko, the battle has started!

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:58.160
I read that you hoped to get 
into a private prep school.

00:12:58.160 --> 00:12:59.290
I thought that was just like you.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:04.550
Listen, Hokkaido has a lot of snow,

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:07.680
but the snow on the street is melting now.

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:10.560
Huh? What am I saying?

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:11.560
Suzuko...

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:16.360
I missed you. I missed you so much.

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:20.800
There was so much I wanted 
to say when we met again...

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:24.840
So—

00:13:24.840 --> 00:13:26.050
Turn end?

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:28.690
Chi-chan...

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:31.860
Yeah.

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:33.080
Do you understand?

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:34.750
You have one coin left.

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:38.000
If you lose this battle, you'll disappear!

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:39.420
Suzu!

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:47.610
Turn end.

00:13:48.780 --> 00:13:52.550
In my last year of middle school, 
my father's company went bankrupt.

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:55.440
We sold the house

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:57.380
and moved from one place to another.

00:13:57.380 --> 00:13:59.800
I didn't have time to send letters.

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:03.530
I kept up part-time jobs 
while I went to high school.

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:08.180
One slip, and everything would be over.

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:11.780
Every day was like that, 
but I kept working so hard

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:13.650
to be the person you admired.

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:14.800
And what happened?

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:15.700
Chi-chan...

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:17.640
I can feel it.

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:21.300
The Selector me is the real me.

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:23.800
No one ties me down.

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:25.710
I'm free, and I'm getting stronger.

00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:28.620
And I can see it clearly.

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:33.140
The ugly thing within me.

00:14:34.380 --> 00:14:36.100
It's you, Suzu!

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:38.800
Meru, grow.

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:40.730
Summon Mayo.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:41.990
Coin bet.

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:44.710
Berserk.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:47.060
She used her coin!

00:14:47.060 --> 00:14:50.220
<i>Suzuko has to attack next turn.</i>

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:52.620
Meru, attack!

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:55.160
Riru!

00:14:55.730 --> 00:14:56.660
Turn end.

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:00.740
Riru...

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:02.430
Use your coin.

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:06.430
If you learn what she has in 
her hand, you can still...

00:15:06.430 --> 00:15:06.920
But...

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:08.790
At this rate, you'll lose.

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:10.080
Is that okay with you?

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:12.890
But I can't fight Chi-chan.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.010
N-No!

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:16.320
It's hopeless.

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:18.420
You can't defy Berserk.

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:23.270
Full...

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:25.480
attack.

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:29.990
ARTS: End of Heart.

00:15:36.220 --> 00:15:38.540
R-Riru, I...

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:41.000
Suzuko, just keep looking forward.

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:43.780
If there's something important to you,

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:46.540
a memory you don't want to lose, then fight.

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:48.000
But...

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:49.460
I see.

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:55.390
It's that LRIG that's holding 
your hand right now, isn't it?

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:56.960
Riru...

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.100
Riru and Meru.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.390
Together forever.

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:03.600
No matter what happens, 
we'll be together forever!

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:05.560
It makes me want to vomit.

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:08.020
Disappear! Never let me see you again!

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:09.530
She's using her coin again!

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:11.740
Coin bet!

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:13.410
Berserk.

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:17.300
N-No...

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:20.160
No!

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:22.720
If I attack, Riru will...

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:24.820
We told you, you can't help it.

00:16:24.820 --> 00:16:26.920
Summon Armile.

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:30.720
Attack...

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:33.220
below!

00:16:33.520 --> 00:16:34.090
Below?

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:48.820
What was that?

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.860
she attacked somewhere that wasn't

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:54.030
part of the field to block the counter?

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:56.660
Suzu's interesting, isn't she?

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:58.780
Turn end...

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:01.620
Meru, grow.

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:04.060
Accessorize Teaksauce.

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:06.330
Steak gains Lancer.

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:07.620
Attack!

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:11.720
Goodbye, Suzu.

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:13.840
What?

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:24.480
No way...

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:27.310
Could she have done that deliberately?

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:31.230
She used Berserk to protect herself?

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:33.970
Riru, are you okay?

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:35.070
Yes.

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:35.860
I'm glad...

00:17:37.940 --> 00:17:40.440
<i>I never would have thought of that.</i>

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:44.200
<i>That's the way it always was.</i>

00:17:46.820 --> 00:17:48.290
Everything's wet!

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.540
Want to play at home today?

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.560
Hey, I've got a good idea!

00:17:59.110 --> 00:18:01.060
It's cold, and it feels great!

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:03.850
Join me, Chi-chan!

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:04.560
Okay!

00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:08.400
Suzu-chan, what are you doing?

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:11.200
When you do this, it's cold and it feels good!

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:12.450
You're right!

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:14.190
It feels great.

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:18.400
<i>I hated it.</i>

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:29.090
Bye-bye, Suzu-chan!

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:30.220
Bye-bye!

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:31.550
See you later!

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:35.650
Chi-chan?

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:37.270
<i>I hated it.</i>

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:41.320
You shouldn't run in the rain. 
You'll catch a cold.

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:42.040
<i>She got what I wanted, with no effort at all.</i>

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:43.170
Am I gonna get in trouble?

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:43.170
<i>Her smile...</i>

00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:44.390
Don't worry.

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:46.380
I'll tell them you tripped.

00:18:46.380 --> 00:18:47.600
Really?

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:49.420
Thanks, Chi-chan.

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:50.210
All done!

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:51.650
You can put on your boots.

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:55.190
Thanks, Chi-chan!

00:18:55.770 --> 00:18:58.570
From now on, I'll protect you.

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:02.280
So don't ever leave me.

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.280
<i>I hated it.</i>

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:04.310
Okay!

00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:06.680
<i>I wanted her smile to be mine alone.</i>

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:10.500
<i>I hated myself for the twisted 
relationship I was building.</i>

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:13.800
I don't need you!

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:16.960
Disappear from within me, Suzu!

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:18.010
Chi-chan, wait!

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:20.200
Meru, attack!

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:35.440
Hey, what are you doing?

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:37.530
You can't be in here. It's dangerous.

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:39.880
What's going on?

00:19:39.880 --> 00:19:44.620
If a third party approaches during 
a battle, the match is canceled.

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:47.080
This battle doesn't count.

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:48.820
Doesn't count...

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:52.750
I wish you'd disappeared.

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:06.760
Chi-chan was serious.

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:08.720
Disappear, Suzu!

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:11.620
If I disappear...

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:14.030
If...

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:18.400
If I don't fight any more battles 
and lose my memories...

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.680
Can you abandon her?

00:20:21.690 --> 00:20:23.240
You're her friend, aren't you?

00:20:24.310 --> 00:20:25.160
Yeah.

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:27.680
And this is okay with you?

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:33.250
You just have to protect her.

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:35.960
Me?

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:38.050
Remember, Suzu.

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:51.460
That's really big!

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:57.020
I'm Homura Suzuko.

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:57.860
Who are you?

00:21:00.090 --> 00:21:02.120
Morikawa Chinatsu...

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:03.880
Chi-chan, then!

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:09.480
Chi-chan, let's read together.

00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:10.160
Okay.

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:12.200
Morning, Chi-chan!

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:12.950
Morning.

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:30.100
Riru, why?

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:33.780
Because I have all of your 
memories within me.

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:37.450
Thank you, Riru.

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:41.410
<i>At first, it was different...</i>

00:21:41.410 --> 00:21:43.820
<i>Who I wanted to be, who I admired.</i>

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:46.820
<i>If I were stronger...</i>

00:21:47.340 --> 00:21:49.240
<i>If I could go back to how things were,</i>

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:50.960
<i>I know...</i>

00:21:53.940 --> 00:21:56.000
<i>I won't run away anymore.</i>

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:28.200
I thought that I had to be strong.

00:23:28.200 --> 00:23:29.130
Want to join me?

00:23:28.780 --> 00:23:32.420
Because I have a reason 
I must fight the battles.

00:23:32.150 --> 00:23:34.240
Aren't you the one tying yourself down?

00:23:34.240 --> 00:23:35.160
Want to do it with me?

00:23:35.160 --> 00:23:36.880
Are you really Morikawa?

00:23:37.390 --> 00:23:40.620
Next time: Evolution / Pure White 
and Pitch Black.

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:41.020
Evolution / Pure White and Pitch Black
